Package: gbe-fork-bin
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: libstdc++6, ${misc:Depends}
Provides: gbe-fork, goldberg-emu
Description: Goldberg Steam Emulator (gbe_fork) prebuilt steam_api for game packages
 Prebuilt release of gbe_fork, the maintained fork of Mr_Goldberg's Steam
 emulator. Game packages in jm2/linux-packages link their steam_api(64).dll or
 libsteam_api.so to the copies in /opt/gbe-fork (Windows) and /usr/lib/gbe-fork
 (Linux), so an emulator update reaches every game without rebuilding it. Also
 ships gbe-steam-interfaces, which writes steam_interfaces.txt for an original steam_api library.
